OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits drugging and raping
OL,4,Awife over 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of drugging and raping
OL,7,Fhis wife without her knowledge over a
OL,8,F20-year period has admitted 60 offences
OL,9,Fagainst her.
OL,11,FThe husband, who cannot be named to
OL,12,Fprotect his wife's legal right to
OL,13,Fanonymity, had already admitted some
OL,14,Fcounts at Manchester Minshull Street
OL,15,FCrown Court, including rape.
OL,17,FThe wife watched proceedings from the
OL,18,Fpublic gallery supported by members of
OL,19,Fher family.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
