OL,5,
OL,6,FThe husband, in his sixties, became
OL,7,Fvisibly emotional as he repeated the
OL,8,Fword guilty to dozens of charges -
OL,9,Fincluding multiple counts of rape,
OL,10,Fassault by penetration and
OL,11,Fadministering a substance with intent -
OL,12,Fand at one point was invited to sit
OL,13,Fdown in the dock by the judge.
